{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>בלע</b> — The lamed is opened [with a pathach] because of the guttural letter." "<b>פלג לשונם</b> — A way of elegance." "And the meaning of פלג — they lied like what happened to the generation of the division [Pelag], for all of them gathered in the city to do violence to me."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 55, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:31:59.930463841Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}